<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young sprout, shoot,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ᾽ ἀνέδραμεν ἔρνεϊ ἶσος</span>
			shot up like
			<i>a young plant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.56
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.175
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον δὲ τρέφει ἔ. ἀνὴρ ἐριθηλὲς
					ἐλαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.163
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιεροῖσιν ὑφ᾽ ἕρνεσιν</span>
			(sic codd. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰναρέοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ibyc.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. δάφνης, δόνακος, ὕλας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1213
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				183
			</span></i> (lyr.),<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				876
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			pl., <i>wreaths</i> worn by victors in games, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				11.29
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				1.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>scion, offspring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>N.</u>
				6.37
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.87
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1525
			</span></i>(lyr.),<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				661
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				666
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1108
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4229.10
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρακλέος ἱερὸν ἔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τῆς νηδύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1306
				</span></i>
			 ; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράων] ἔ.,</span> periphr.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέραα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.210
			</span></i> ; of Delos, as <i>having sprung out of the sea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fruit,</i> of the apple of Discord, <i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				60
			</span></i>,al.</div>
